# Paper Boats in a Thunderstorm
#
# No drums. The weather is the arrangement: the rain's DENSITY is the arc.
# A few drops, one side then the other; drops trading left and right in
# eighths; a sixteenth downpour where the two sides interlock; single drops
# again. The 7/8 (2+2+3) lives in the instruments — the bass pulses it and
# the rain accents it — and one motif (B-E-F#-G, the first thing the voice
# sings) is what the drops, the storm and the lullaby are all made of.
#
# Voices, each with one job and one place:
#   rain   Bocuma plucks, split hard left and right; velocity is weather
#          (accents open the filter, soft drops stay dark)
#   lead   Kaini B in mono: centre, fairly dry, sliding where notes touch
#   bass   Kaini in mono with a sub: the pulse, then the far thunder
#   bloom  Bocuma chords in the calm, wide and wet, blooming and fading
#
# Form (a 7/8 bar is 3.5 beats; bar n starts at beat 3.5*(n-1)):
#   1-4    drops              Em9 Em9 Cmaj7#11 Cmaj7#11
#   5-8    the song           the voice enters; the bass lays a floor
#   9-12   gathering          Em9 Cmaj7#11 Am9 B7sus4; drops trade in
#                             eighths, the bass starts to pulse, tempo leans
#   13-16  the storm          sixteenth downpour, driven bass, the scream
#   --     half a beat of nothing
#   17-22  the calm (72 bpm)  blooms, the song as a lullaby, a few drops
#   23     far thunder        a low rumble under a line gliding an octave down

bpm 132
gate 0.9
tail 6

automate bpm
132 R:28 150:26@smooth R:2 72:0.01@step R:21 60:6@smooth

# --- the room
automate chorus_mode
2
automate chorus_rate
0.37
automate chorus_depth
0.2
automate chorus_hiss
0.35
automate spring
0.1
automate width
1.25
automate tape_flutter
0.05
automate tape_age
0.25
automate tape_drive
0.3 R:42 0.45:12@smooth R:2 0.25:0.01@step
automate tape_wow
0.22 R:42 0.16:2@smooth R:12 0.42:0.01@step R:21 0.55:6@smooth
automate reverb_tone
4200
automate reverb_wet
0.3 R:28 0.24:14@smooth R:14 0.44:0.01@step R:27
automate reverb_decay
0.72 R:56 0.86:0.01@step R:27

# Germanium: absent in the rain, an edge as the storm gathers, gone with it.
automate fuzz
0 R:35 0.18:7@smooth 0.42:12@smooth R:1.5 0:0.5@step R:27

# The bus compressor, parallel: holds the storm together, lets the calm breathe.
automate comp_in
1
automate comp_threshold
-26
automate comp_ratio
1
automate comp_attack
3
automate comp_release
4
automate comp_makeup
3
automate comp_mix
0.5

# --- rain, left
track rainL vel=0.4 len=0.5 patch=bocuma gain=1.6 pan=-0.85 reverb_send=0.2
# 1-8: drops
(B3@0.45 R R E4@0.3 R R R R R G4@0.4 R R F#4@0.25 R R E4@0.4 R R R B3@0.3 R G3@0.35 R R R F#4@0.45 R R)x2
# 9-12: trading eighths (left on 1 3 5 7)
E4@0.65 R B3@0.39 R G4@0.72 R F#4@0.39
E4@0.65 R G3@0.39 R F#4@0.72 R B3@0.39
C4@0.65 R A3@0.39 R E4@0.72 R B3@0.39
F#4@0.72 R B3@0.45 R A4@0.78 R E4@0.45
# 13-16: the downpour
E4@0.8 B3@0.4 G4@0.7 B3@0.35 F#4@0.75 D4@0.35 B3@0.45
E4@0.8 G3@0.4 F#4@0.7 G3@0.35 B4@0.75 G3@0.35 E4@0.45
C4@0.8 A3@0.4 E4@0.7 A3@0.35 B4@0.75 E4@0.35 C4@0.5
F#4@0.85 B3@0.45 A4@0.8 B3@0.45 E5@0.9 B3@0.5 R
# 17-22: a few drops
R R E4@0.2 R R R R
R R R R B3@0.18 R R
R C4@0.2 R R R R R
R R R R R G3@0.15 R
R R B3@0.18 R R R R
R R R R R R R
# 23: the last one
R R R R E4@0.12

# --- rain, right
track rainR vel=0.4 len=0.5 patch=bocuma gain=1.6 pan=0.85 reverb_send=0.2
# 1-8: drops, between the left's
(R R R R R D4@0.25 R B3@0.3 R R R R R E4@0.2 R R R G4@0.35 R R R R R B3@0.25 R R R E4@0.3)x2
# 9-12: trading eighths (right on 2 4 6)
R D4@0.39 R B3@0.45 R E4@0.52 R
R G4@0.39 R C4@0.45 R E4@0.52 R
R G3@0.39 R C4@0.45 R G4@0.52 R
R E4@0.39 R F#3@0.45 R B3@0.52 R
# 13-16: the downpour, a sixteenth behind the left
R:0.25
G4@0.45 D4@0.3 B4@0.5 E4@0.3 D5@0.5 B3@0.3 G4@0.35
G4@0.45 E4@0.3 B4@0.5 C4@0.3 F#4@0.5 E4@0.3 G4@0.35
E4@0.45 C4@0.3 G4@0.5 E4@0.3 C5@0.5 A3@0.3 E4@0.4
B4@0.5 F#4@0.35 E5@0.55 A4@0.35 B4@0.6 R:0.75
# 17-22: a few drops
R R R R R G4@0.15 R
F#4@0.18 R R R R R R
R R R E4@0.18 R R R
R R R R R R R
R R R R F#4@0.15 R R
R R B3@0.12 R R R R

automate rainL.vel_filter
2.2
automate rainL.vel_amp
0.85
automate rainR.vel_filter
2.2
automate rainR.vel_amp
0.85

# --- lead: Kaini B, mono, centre
track lead vel=0.6 patch=kaini-b gain=1.5 reverb_send=0.18
>14
# 5-8: the song, entering softly — the crescendo runs to the storm
R:0.5 B3:0.5@0.35 E4:1@0.56 F#4:0.5@0.39 G4:1@0.52
F#4:0.5@0.35 E4:0.5@0.32 B3:2.5@0.49
R:0.5 B3:0.5@0.35 E4:1@0.56 F#4:0.5@0.39 G4:0.5@0.42 A4:0.5@0.59
B4:2@0.63 A4:0.5@0.35 G4:1@0.42
# 9-12: the song again, leaning in
R:0.5 B3:0.5@0.6 E4:1@0.85 F#4:0.5@0.6 G4:1@0.8
A4:1@0.75 G4:0.5@0.55 E4:2@0.7
R:0.5 C4:0.5@0.6 E4:1@0.8 G4:0.5@0.65 A4:1@0.85
B4:2@0.9 A4:0.5@0.6 F#4:1@0.7
# 13-16: the storm
B4:0.5@0.9 B4:0.5@0.5 D5:0.5@0.7 B4:0.5@0.45 E5:1.5@1.0
D5:0.5@0.7 C5:0.5@0.6 B4:0.5@0.65 A4:0.5@0.6 G4:1.5@0.85
F#4:0.5@0.7 G4:0.5@0.75 A4:0.5@0.8 B4:0.5@0.85 C5:0.5@0.9 D5:0.5@0.95 E5:0.5@1.0
E5:3@1.0 R:0.5
# 17-22: the calm — the song as a lullaby
R:1 B3:1@0.35 E4:1.5@0.45
F#4:1@0.4 G4:2.5@0.5
F#4:1@0.35 E4:1@0.3 B3:1.5@0.4
R:1 B3:0.5@0.3 E4:1@0.4 F#4:1@0.45
G4:1.5@0.5 A4:1@0.55 B4:1@0.6
B4:3.5@0.5
# 23
E4:2@0.4 E3:4@0.35

automate lead.vel_filter
1.6
automate lead.glide
0.07 R:56 0.35:0.01@step R:21 1.2:0.01@step
# the scream bends down a whole tone; the lullaby's last note sags
automate lead.pitch_shift
0 R:52.5 -2:3@smooth 0:0.01@step R:17.49 -0.3:3.5@smooth 0:0.01@step

# --- bass: Kaini, mono, a sub underneath
track bass vel=0.7 patch=kaini gain=1.3
>21
# 7-8: a floor
E2:7@0.45
# 9-12: the pulse, 2+2+3
E2:1@0.6 E2:1@0.45 B1:1.5@0.55
C2:1@0.6 C2:1@0.45 G1:1.5@0.55
A1:1@0.6 A1:1@0.45 E1:1.5@0.55
B1:1@0.65 B1:1@0.5 F#1:1.5@0.6
# 13-16: driven
E2:0.5@0.9 E2:0.5@0.5 G2:0.5@0.7 E2:0.5@0.4 B1:0.5@0.8 D2:0.5@0.5 E2:0.5@0.6
C2:0.5@0.9 C2:0.5@0.5 E2:0.5@0.7 C2:0.5@0.4 G1:0.5@0.8 B1:0.5@0.5 C2:0.5@0.6
A1:0.5@0.9 A1:0.5@0.5 C2:0.5@0.7 A1:0.5@0.4 E1:0.5@0.8 G1:0.5@0.5 A1:0.5@0.6
B1:0.5@1.0 B1:0.5@0.5 D2:0.5@0.75 B1:0.5@0.45 F#1:0.5@0.9 A1:0.5@0.6 R:0.5
# 23: far thunder
>77
E1:6@0.4

automate bass.mono
1
automate bass.sub
0.4
automate bass.glide
0.03
# the thunder rolls in and never strikes
automate bass.attack
0.012 R:76.9 1.8:0.05@step
automate bass.cutoff
640 R:76.9 260:0.05@step

# --- bloom: Bocuma chords in the calm, wide and wet
track bloom vel=0.5 patch=bocuma reverb_send=0.45
>56
[C3 G3 B3 F#4]:7@0.55
[A2 E3 G3 B3 C4]:7@0.5
[E2 B2 G3 F#4]:7@0.45
[E2 B2 G3 D4 F#4]:6@0.4
